OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBrisk southwest winds. Rather
OL,6,Fcloudy with best of any limited
OL,7,Fbrighter spells expected towards
OL,8,FInverness. Some in east staying dry,
OL,9,Fbut most seeing some patchy rain,
OL,10,Fwhich turns more persistent in the
OL,11,Fwest during the late afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FOvercast with periods of
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy rain through the
OL,15,Fevening, which turns patchy and
OL,16,Foccasionally wintry to low levels
OL,17,Fovernight, as fresh to strong
OL,18,Fnortherly winds develop.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
