OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FCloud, rain, sleet and hill
OL,6,Fsnow initially, erratically clearing
OL,7,Fas sunshine and wintry showers follow
OL,8,Ffrom northwest through the day, with
OL,9,Foutbreaks focused over west areas.
OL,10,FMuch colder than Saturday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,13,FShowers throughout across most areas,
OL,14,Fbut always drier and brighter towards
OL,15,Fthe southern end of the great Glen.
OL,16,FTemperatures seasonally low given the
OL,17,Fgenerally northerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
